pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: left-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 4, 80]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: ch-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 1100, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Arm CCA 细粒度隔离与部署模型</strong></p>
  - elementId: ch-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 160, 1100, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>从 VM 级 Realm 扩展到用户态、容器与细粒度内存保护</p>
  - elementId: ch-intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 220, 1100, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>核心是先界定保护对象、管理边界和证据强度，再用三篇主讲材料串起技术演进。</p>
        <p>从 VM 级 Realm 扩展到用户态、容器、进程内与移动/Android 部署。</p>
  - elementId: ch-papers
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 320, 1100, 360]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>本方向三篇主讲材料：</strong></p>
        <ul>
        <li><strong>Shelter: CCA 用户态隔离</strong> — 开创/基础入口，E1 / 基础证据</li>
        <li><strong>RContainer: CCA 安全容器</strong> — 代表性改进，E1 / 同行评审改进证据</li>
        <li><strong>NanoZone: CCA 细粒度内存保护</strong> — 当前 SOTA/补充边界，E3 / 草案/未批准规范</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
